{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415512","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415512","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1041551201:1":{"text":"缤纷的焰火，华丽的灯光……每到春焰庆，连黑夜都会暂时消退啊。","source_cn":"缤纷的焰火，华丽的灯光……每到春焰庆，连黑夜都会暂时消退啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21674D6A3B4C4B7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041551202:1":{"text":"先是“逐夜”，之后“开阳”。","source_cn":"先是“逐夜”，之后“开阳”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4E406C303FF5FF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041551203:1":{"text":"传说中，人类对抗奇异的怪物，最终驱逐长夜，带来黎明……","source_cn":"传说中，人类对抗奇异的怪物，最终驱逐长夜，带来黎明……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC27A32E1052ACAD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041551204:1":{"text":"而在故事的边角，我们或许能窥见些许真实的历史。","source_cn":"而在故事的边角，我们或许能窥见些许真实的历史。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB0A0B26F652951F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041551205:1":{"text":"我有所耳闻。无可抵挡的强大怪兽，与使用火焰与智慧，模仿着怪兽姿态的人类……","source_cn":"我有所耳闻。无可抵挡的强大怪兽，与使用火焰与智慧，模仿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FAD95076AEEBDB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041551206:1":{"text":"很多人都认为，那或许象征着古老的神明与魔法师……是人类之躯比肩神明的最初过往。","source_cn":"很多人都认为，那或许象征着古老的神明与魔法师……是人类...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1592717657BDB861","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041551207:1":{"text":"那么，你认为那真实的吗？还是只是古老故事的演绎？","source_cn":"那么，你认为那真实的吗？还是只是古老故事的演绎？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1A8FEA28975E1A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041551208:1":{"text":"历史的真实与否我不敢断言……但，至少有一点我想是不可否认的。","source_cn":"历史的真实与否我不敢断言……但，至少有一点我想是不可否认的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x083DE64E2A489378","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041551209:1":{"text":"用血肉之躯对抗无情的恶兽，用自己的双手创造崭新的黎明。","source_cn":"用血肉之躯对抗无情的恶兽，用自己的双手创造崭新的黎明。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4AFB0E2939B8753","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041551210:1":{"text":"我相信，那份洋溢于心的勇气，无论多少时光流淌，都绝非虚假。","source_cn":"我相信，那份洋溢于心的勇气，无论多少时光流淌，都绝非虚假。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2180A7DDD4DEC8BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speake